BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:California Fights Forward: Statewide Day of Action in Lake County 
 CA
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261010T150000
UID:ff78d8f0ef4320bd5a4a82c8ee14347c@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/organization/14_20260915200214099189.png
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Saturday\, October 10\, for the California Fights F
 orward: Statewide Day of Action. Our success in the primary showed that we
  achieve more when we work together toward a shared goal. Join us as we kn
 ock on doors to elect Democrats down ballot and take back the House. Noted
  location is subject to change. Rain day plan is to do phones instead.
LOCATION:Lakeport\, CA
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/cadems/event/1043083/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Canvass for Congressman Mike Thompson in Hidden Valley Lake
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260927T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260927T140000
UID:ebf04bb1161f59d662531a5c63fa00ce@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Mike%20T%20Canvass%20Thumbnail%204_20260921175307028708.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join fellow volunteers in Hidden Valley Lake for a neighborhoo
 d canvass supporting Congressman Mike Thompson. Volunteers will engage wit
 h voters\, share information about Congressman Thompson’s work and prior
 ities\, and encourage civic participation in our community. No prior canva
 ssing experience is required. Training\, materials\, and talking points wi
 ll be provided before we begin. Whether you are a first-time volunteer or 
 an experienced organizer\, your participation will help strengthen Democra
 t
LOCATION:Hidden Valley Lake\, CA
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/cadems/event/1041291/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
